WEBVTT

00:00:05.488 --> 00:00:11.748
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> This photo is a remake of a popular painting by Grant Wood called <i>American Gothic</i>.

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:16.916
In the photo, two people are standing on the balcony of a flat,

00:00:17.778 --> 00:00:20.352
or perhaps on the roof of a building.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.855
On the right of the photo, there’s a man.

00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:26.932
He’s probably about 30.

00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:31.413
He’s wearing jeans, an orange top, and black boots.

00:00:32.343 --> 00:00:35.294
He’s holding a garden fork in his hand.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.712
Next to him, there’s a woman.

00:00:41.586 --> 00:00:45.297
She’s a bit younger, about 25.

00:00:46.272 --> 00:00:52.557
She’s probably his girlfriend, or maybe his wife, because they’re holding hands.

00:00:53.912 --> 00:00:56.156
She has wavy brown hair.

00:00:57.006 --> 00:01:01.257
It’s medium length, not long, but not really short.

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:05.929
She’s wearing a light blue hoodie, jeans, and boots.

00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:09.964
She’s also wearing a bag round her waist.

00:01:10.605 --> 00:01:13.852
In her hand, she’s holding a watering can.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.000
The couple look happy.

00:01:16.453 --> 00:01:17.615
They’re both smiling.

00:01:18.952 --> 00:01:24.673
In the front of the photo, there are some pink flowers and some other green plants.

00:01:26.188 --> 00:01:30.953
In the background, you can see the city, with many big modern buildings.

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:33.437
Perhaps they’re offices, or flats.

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:37.881
This is the original painting.

00:01:38.311 --> 00:01:40.247
It was painted in 1930,

00:01:40.592 --> 00:01:44.561
and it shows an old farmer and his daughter in front of their house.